    {
      "id": "d12969448a5a-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If a x = b, b y = c and c z = a 2 , then what is the value of xyz? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a x = b, b y = c &#2324;&#2352; c z = a 2 , &#2340;&#2379; xyz &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>x</sup> = b, b<sup>y</sup> = c and c<sup>z</sup> = a<sup>2</sup>, then what is the value of xyz?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>x</sup> = b, b<sup>y</sup> = c &#2324;&#2352; c<sup>z</sup> = a<sup>2</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; xyz &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-1 -1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">-1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "0 0",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1 1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>It is given that, c<sup>z</sup> = a<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; (b<sup>y</sup>)<sup>z</sup> = c<sup>z</sup> = a<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; (a<sup>x</sup>)<sup>yz</sup> = a<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; a<sup>xyz</sup> = a<sup>2</sup></p><p>Hence, xyz = 2</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d12969448a5a-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If 9 (12/x) &div; 27 (x - 4) = 3 10 , then what is the value of [(2 x - x 2 )/7], where 'x' is a positive integer? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 9 (12/x) &div; 27 (x - 4) = 3 10 , &#2340;&#2379; [(2 x - x 2 )/7] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; 'x' &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 9<sup>(12/x)</sup> &div; 27<sup>(x  -  4)</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup>, then what is the value of [(2<sup>x</sup>  -  x<sup>2</sup>)/7], where 'x' is a positive integer?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 9<sup>(12/x)</sup> &div; 27<sup>(x - 4)</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; [(2<sup>x</sup> - x<sup>2</sup>)/7] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; 'x' &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6 6",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4 4",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>9<sup>(12/x)</sup> &div; 27<sup>(x  -  4)</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></p><p>(3<sup>2</sup>)<sup>(12/x)</sup> * (3<sup>3</sup>)<sup>(x  -  4)</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></p><p>3<sup>(24/x)</sup> * 3<sup>(3x  -  12)</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></p><p>3<sup>[(24/x) + 3x  -  12]</sup> = 3<sup>10</sup></p><p>(24/x) + 3x  -  12 = 10</p><p>(24/x) + 3x = 22</p><p>24 + 3x<sup>2</sup> = 22x</p><p>3x<sup>2</sup>  -  22x + 24 = 0</p><p>(x  -  6)(3x  -  4) = 0</p><p>x = 6 and 4/3</p><p>Since 'x' is positive integer. So, x &#8800; 4/3</p><p>= [(2<sup>x</sup>  -  x<sup>2</sup>)/7]</p><p>= [(2<sup>6</sup>  -  6<sup>2</sup>)/7]</p><p>= (64  -  36)/7</p><p>= 28/7</p><p>= 4</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d12969448a5a-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If 81 * 27 (m + 2) = 3 n , and 3125 (n + 3) * 125 4 = 5 m , then which of the following is correct? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 81 * 27 (m + 2) = 3 n , &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 3125 (n + 3) * 125 4 = 5 m , &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup>, and 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>, then which of the following is correct?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup>, &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "m = 13/2 and n = 11/2 m = 13/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = 11/2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">m = 13/2 and n = 11/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">m = 13/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = 11/2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "m = 11/2 and n = 13/2 m = 11/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = 13/2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">m = 11/2 and n = 13/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">m = 11/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = 13/2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "m = -11/2 and n = -13/2 m = -11/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = -13/2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">m = -11/2 and n = -13/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">m = -11/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = -13/2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "m = -13/2 and n = -11/2 m = -13/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = -11/2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">m = -13/2 and n = -11/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">m = -13/2 &#2324;&#2352; n = -11/2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>81 * 27<sup>(m + 2)</sup> = 3<sup>n</sup></p><p>=&gt; 3<sup>4 + 3(m + 2) </sup>= 3<sup>n</sup></p><p>=&gt; 4 + 3m + 6 = n</p><p>=&gt; 3m  -  n + 10 = 0----(1)</p><p>And 3125<sup>(n + 3)</sup> * 125<sup>4</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup></p><p>=&gt; 5<sup>5(n + 3) + 12</sup> = 5<sup>m</sup></p><p>=&gt; 5n + 15 + 12 = m</p><p>=&gt; 5n  -  m + 27 = 0---(2)</p><p>Solving equations (1), and (2), we get</p><p>m = -11/2 and n = -13/2</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
