      "id": "d12969448a5a-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "If 7 (a + b) = 343 and 49 (a - b) = 2401, find the value of 3a. &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7 (a + b) = 343 &#2324;&#2352; 49 (a - b) = 2401 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 3a &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 7 <sup>(a + b) </sup>= 343 and 49 <sup>(a  -  b) </sup>= 2401, find the value of 3a.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7 <sup>(a + b) </sup>= 343 &#2324;&#2352; 49 <sup>(a - b) </sup>= 2401 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 3a &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "9 9",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15/2 15/2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">15/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15/2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "8 8",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1 1",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>7<sup>(a+b)</sup> =343=7<sup>3</sup></p><p>So, a + b = 3 .. (1)</p><p>49<sup>(a-b)</sup> = 2401 = 49<sup>2</sup></p><p>So, a - b = 2 .. (2)</p><p>Add eq (1) and (2),</p><p>2a = 5</p><p>Or 3a = 5 x 3/2 = 15/2</p>",
      "images": [],
