      "question": "If A = 10 400 , B = 8 200 , and C = 6 800 , then which of the following is true? &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A = 10 400 , B = 8 200 , &#2324;&#2352; C = 6 800 , &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If A = 10<sup>400</sup>, B = 8<sup>200</sup>, and C = 6<sup>800</sup>, then which of the following is true?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A = 10<sup>400</sup>, B = 8<sup>200</sup>, &#2324;&#2352; C = 6<sup>800</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
